#: energy.cpp:107
msgid "Learn more about the Energy Star program"
msgstr "Informationên bifirehî jibo Energy-Star-Program"

#: energy.cpp:142
msgid "&Enable display power management"
msgstr "&Aktîvkirina birêvebirê elektrîka display"

#: energy.cpp:145
msgid "Check this option to enable the power saving features of your display."
msgstr "Evê dananê aktîv bike, heger tu bixwaze birêvebirê elektrîka display bête pêxistin."

#: energy.cpp:148
msgid "Your display does not support power saving."
msgstr "Display a te komeka power saving nake."

#: energy.cpp:159
msgid "&Standby after:"
msgstr "&Amade be piştî:"

#: energy.cpp:161 energy.cpp:172 energy.cpp:184
msgid " min"
msgstr " min."

#: energy.cpp:162 energy.cpp:173 energy.cpp:185
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Neaktîvkirî"

#: energy.cpp:165
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should enter "
"\"standby\" mode. This is the first level of power saving."
msgstr ""
"Sînora demî hilbijêre, ya ku piştî wê displaya te dikeve rewsha (\"Amade\"). "
"Evaya perçê yekemîne ji.' birêvebirê elektrîka display '."

#: energy.cpp:170
msgid "S&uspend after:"
msgstr "&Rawestan piştî:"

#: energy.cpp:176
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should enter "
"\"suspend\" mode. This is the second level of power saving, but may not be "
"different from the first level for some displays."
msgstr ""
"Sînora demî hilbijêre, ya ku piştî wê displaya te dikeve rewsha (\"Amade\"). "
"Evaya perçak duweme ji.' birêvebirê elektrîka display ' "
"ji gelek displayan re ev tişt wekî perçê(leve) yekemîne."

#: energy.cpp:182
msgid "&Power off after:"
msgstr "&Wuze (power) biqetîne piştî:"

#: energy.cpp:188
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should be powered "
"off. This is the greatest level of power saving that can be achieved while "
"the display is still physically turned on."
msgstr ""
"Sînora demî hilbijêre, ya ku piştî wê Monîtora dikeve rewsha (\"Vemrandin\")."
"Evaya perçê dawîye ji.' birêvebirê elektrîka display ' "
"Display bixwe fîzîkî pêxistî dimîne."

#: energy.cpp:420
msgid ""
"<h1>Display Power Control</h1> If your display supports power saving "
"features, you can configure them using this module."
"<p> There are three levels of power saving: standby, suspend, and off. The "
"greater the level of power saving, the longer it takes for the display to "
"return to an active state."
"<p> To wake up the display from a power saving mode, you can make a small "
"movement with the mouse, or press a key that is not likely to cause any "
"unintended side-effects, for example, the \"shift\" key."
msgstr ""
"<h1>birêvebirê elektrîka display</h1> Heger Monîtora te alîkarîya "
"'birêvebirê elektrîka display' dike, tê kari bi van funktionan bikarbîne."
"<p>Ew bixwe 3 perçe hene ji 'birêvebirê elektrîka display' re amade (standby), "
"rawestan (suspend) û vemrandin. Çendî perçê(level) 'birêvebirê elektrîka display' "
"bilind be wissa wê displaya te gelek dem bixwe heta ku ew dîsa pêkeve."
"<p>Jibo ku tu dîsa li displaya xwe temaşebike, yan levandinekê biçûk bi mişkê "
"xwe çêk yan jî pêl Tast-ekê bik, lê wê çêtir be heger tu li tasta \"shift\" nexe."

